Preamble prose for the stateful playbook.

## Playbook Steps

Execute the steps in the most effective order considering their dependencies.

| Step | Dependencies | Summary | Review gate |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `intake` | — | intake summary | — |
| `step-pipeline` *(subgraph)* | `intake` | once per item the intake names | — |
| `spec` *(in step-pipeline)* | — | spec summary | — |
| `review` *(in step-pipeline)* | `spec` | review summary | — |

## State

Run state is persisted in artifacts under the run workdir. Only `booping playbook-transition` writes it — never hand-edit an artifact's `status`.

Read the whole run's frontier before starting or resuming:

```
booping playbook-state fx-stateful --workdir <run workdir>
```

### State: main

- Referenced by: outer graph
- Artifact: `index.md` (relative to the run workdir)
- Initial status: `intaking`
- Advance: `booping playbook-transition fx-stateful <to> --workdir <run workdir>`

| Status | To | When | Gates |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `intaking` | `developing-steps` | intake step complete | request + scope captured in the artifact |
| `developing-steps` | `done` | every step instance terminal | — |
| `done` | *(terminal)* | — | — |

### State: step

- Referenced by: subgraph `step-pipeline`
- Artifact: `steps/{instance}/index.md` (relative to the run workdir)
- Initial status: `spec-ing`
- Advance: `booping playbook-transition fx-stateful <to> --state step --instance <slug> --workdir <run workdir>`

| Status | To | When | Gates |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `spec-ing` | `reviewing` | spec written | — |
| `reviewing` | `done` | user confirmed the spec | explicit user confirmation captured |
| `done` | *(terminal)* | — | — |

